    "text": "Now, Phil, do you ever struggle to get a good night's sleep? You know, I do sometimes. If I've been thinking about something a lot or even worse, if I've had a cup of coffee later than I should, sometimes I can lie there for hours. Yes. Well, many of us will be familiar with that feeling of lying in bed, feeling really tired, but just not being able to go to sleep. But what causes us to struggle to sleep? And is there anything we can do about it?",
